# WP-PERF (owner 11-18 "World Partition must be optimised too"): measure, then remove the 2-3 costliest places the UE way.
# Timings before/after: DesertEngine-scratch/WP-PERF/timings.txt. Profiles: macOS `sample <editor pid> 15 20` during
# Build HLODs and the Play start, aggregated per function (inclusive samples per thread).
# [1_flight] is the existing headless flight profiler (ShotOptions --flight, FlightRules.hpp), on the same world:
#   Editor --project Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce --play
#          --flight line:-90000,5000,0:90000,5000,0 --flight-speed 6000 --flight-csv <scratch>/WP-PERF/flight.csv
#   -> "[Flight] ... p50/p95/max, frames with activation" in editor.log; CSV per frame (activation ms, records, GPU bytes).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
# Build HLODs: the probe (Plan) no longer encodes the cell payloads it drops (WorldCells::HLODFileOutput::Probe);
# an HLOD's mesh is HLODMesh_<hash>.stmesh beside the cells, named by StaticMesh.MeshHandle (no JSON EditMesh).
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда 0_built панель World Partition: HLOD построены без ошибок; в editor.log «[Build HLODs]» время сборки меньше замера «до» (30 мин)
# The HLOD meshes drawn from their .stmesh in the editor (as WP-EDITOR-HLOD edhlod_shown, 11-18 before WP-PERF):
# a 200 x 200 m region loaded, the rest of the world drawn by its saved HLODs.
Дано set world WorldPartitionEditor.ShowHLODs true
Дано set world WorldPartitionEditor.HLODMinDrawDistance 0
Дано set world WorldPartitionEditor.HLODMaxDrawDistance 0
Дано set world WorldPartitionEditor.Selection -10000,-10000,10000,10000
# Load Region adds a loader and keeps Load All (UE loader adapters), and the world opens as the last run left it:
# every loader off first.
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load Region (map selection)"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60000,-30000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.5
Тогда 0_hlod_top вид сверху 600 м как edhlod_shown WP-EDITOR-HLOD: вокруг квадрата 200x200 м ландшафт HLOD (песок/олива) и силуэты зданий, дыр нет
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,5000,-60000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.12,1
Тогда 0_hlod_low вид с 50 м вдоль +Z: ландшафт HLOD лежит холмами до горизонта, плит в небе нет, небо не просвечивает сквозь землю
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Тогда 1_flight кадр как в WP-PROTOCOL: мир с HLOD вдали, плиты над камерой нет; в editor.log «HLOD … loaded at the start of Play» — время старта Play против «до» (~70 с на ячейку)
Когда run Action "Stop"
# [2_hlod_one_cell]: building 200408 (G0 L0 cell (2,0), at 5464,-1004.1875,2261) moved 1 m along +X, Save, Build HLODs
# again: only its cell and the cells above it rebuild (BuiltFrom checksum, WorldCells::BuildPlannedHLODs keep()).
Когда select 200408
Когда --subject selection set Translation 5564,-1004.1875,2261
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Build HLODs"
Когда wait-idle 2400
Тогда 2_hlod_one_cell вид как 0_built; в логе «built N of 598 HLOD cells (others up to date)» с N = ячейка дома и её родители, время сборки - секунды/минуты против 8 мин полной
# Put the building back so the saved world and its HLODs stay as committed.
Когда select 200408
Когда --subject selection set Translation 5464,-1004.1875,2261
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Build HLODs"
Когда wait-idle 2400
